---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';

const meta = {
  title: 'MSP Playbook - StdOut for Managed Service Providers',
  description: 'How MSPs use StdOut to deliver white-label infrastructure monitoring + AI diagnosis to clients at flat-rate pricing. Multi-tenant, client portals, automated runbook generation.',
  canonical: 'https://stdout.app/msp-playbook'
};
---

<Layout {meta}>
  <main class="playbook">
    <header class="playbook-hero">
      <span class="eyebrow">For MSPs & IT Consultants</span>
      <h1>Turn StdOut into Your White-Label Monitoring Service</h1>
      <p class="lede">Deploy StdOut once, serve unlimited clients. Flat-rate pricing means your margins grow as you scale - no per-client seat penalties, no vendor lock-in, no surprise bills.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="playbook-content">
      <article class="playbook-section">
        <h2>1. Multi-Tenant Architecture</h2>
        <p>One StdOut instance serves multiple clients with workspace isolation. Each client gets their own portal, monitors, and incident history.</p>

        <h3>Deployment Options</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Shared Instance:</strong> One StdOut, workspace separation (recommended for 10+ clients)</li>
          <li><strong>Per-Client Isolated:</strong> Separate Docker instance per client (for strict data residency)</li>
          <li><strong>Hybrid Satellites:</strong> Central StdOut + lightweight agents on client networks</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="playbook-section">
        <h2>2. Client Onboarding (4 Steps)</h2>
        <ol>
          <li><strong>Create Workspace:</strong> Settings → Workspaces → Add Client (assigns subdomain)</li>
          <li><strong>Deploy Satellite:</strong> SSH to client server, run installer with workspace token</li>
          <li><strong>Auto-Discover Services:</strong> Network scan or import from Prometheus/Uptime Kuma</li>
          <li><strong>Grant Portal Access:</strong> Send client login for their isolated dashboard</li>
        </ol>
      </article>

      <article class="playbook-section">
        <h2>3. White-Label Configuration</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Logo & Branding:</strong> Replace StdOut logo with your MSP branding</li>
          <li><strong>Custom Domain:</strong> Point monitoring.yourmsp.com to your instance</li>
          <li><strong>Email Templates:</strong> Customize incident notifications with your header/footer</li>
          <li><strong>PDF Reports:</strong> Auto-generate weekly reports with your MSP logo</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="playbook-section">
        <h2>4. Pricing Strategy</h2>
        <div class="pricing-example">
          <h3>Example: 20 Clients at $99/month</h3>
          <table>
            <tr>
              <td>Annual Revenue</td>
              <td class="revenue">$23,760</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>StdOut License</td>
              <td class="cost">-$149</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Server Hosting</td>
              <td class="cost">-$600</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="total">
              <td><strong>Net Profit</strong></td>
              <td class="profit"><strong>$23,011</strong></td>
            </tr>
          </table>
          <p class="margin-note">97% margin. Add 5 more clients (25 total) with zero increase in StdOut costs.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="playbook-section">
        <h2>5. Auto-Remediation Playbooks</h2>
        <p>Configure StdOut to auto-fix common issues:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Container Crashed:</strong> Auto-restart + update incident</li>
          <li><strong>Disk 95% Full:</strong> Clear temp files, docker prune</li>
          <li><strong>SSL Expiring:</strong> Certbot renew + reload nginx</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="playbook-section">
        <h2>6. Case Study: MidAtlantic IT</h2>
        <p><strong>12 clients, 400 devices, 8 months production</strong></p>
        <ul class="results">
          <li>Cost: $4,200/month (Datadog + PagerDuty) → $65/month (Hetzner server)</li>
          <li>MTTR: 12 minutes → 3 minutes (Observatory auto-detection)</li>
          <li>Auto-remediation: 47% of incidents resolved without human touch</li>
        </ul>
        <blockquote>"StdOut paid for itself in the first month. We now offer monitoring as a premium add-on at $99/month."</blockquote>
      </article>
    </section>

    <footer class="playbook-footer">
      <h2>Start with 1-2 Pilot Clients</h2>
      <p>Deploy StdOut for a proof-of-concept, measure results, then scale to your full client base.</p>
      <div class="cta-buttons">
        <a href="/download" class="btn-primary">Download StdOut</a>
        <a href="/docs/msp-setup" class="btn-secondary">MSP Setup Guide</a>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .playbook {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 40px 20px 80px;
    color: #F0F0F8;
  }

  .playbook-hero {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 60px;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: #FB923C;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FB923C15, #FB923C08);
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .playbook-hero h1 {
    font-size: 42px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
  }

  .lede {
    font-size: 18px;
    color: #C0C0D8;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .playbook-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 50px;
  }

  .playbook-section h2 {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    padding-bottom: 10px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #1F1F35;
  }

  .playbook-section h3 {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #FB923C;
    margin: 30px 0 16px;
  }

  .playbook-section p,
  .playbook-section li {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: #C0C0D8;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .playbook-section ul,
  .playbook-section ol {
    margin: 16px 0;
    padding-left: 24px;
  }

  .playbook-section li {
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .pricing-example {
    background: #0E0E18;
    border: 1px solid #1F1F35;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 24px;
    margin: 20px 0;
  }

  .pricing-example h3 {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    color: #F0F0F8;
  }

  .pricing-example table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .pricing-example td {
    padding: 12px 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #1F1F35;
  }

  .pricing-example .revenue {
    text-align: right;
    font-family: monospace;
    color: #22C55E;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .pricing-example .cost {
    text-align: right;
    font-family: monospace;
    color: #EF4444;
  }

  .pricing-example .total td {
    padding-top: 16px;
    border-top: 2px solid #2A2A40;
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .pricing-example .profit {
    text-align: right;
    font-family: monospace;
    color: #22C55E;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .margin-note {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #9090A8;
    font-style: italic;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .results {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .results li {
    padding: 10px 0;
    color: #22C55E;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #1F1F35;
  }

  blockquote {
    background: #0E0E18;
    border-left: 4px solid #FB923C;
    padding: 20px 24px;
    margin: 24px 0;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #C0C0D8;
  }

  .playbook-footer {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 80px;
    padding: 40px 0;
    border-top: 2px solid #1F1F35;
  }

  .playbook-footer h2 {
    font-size: 32px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .playbook-footer > p {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: #C0C0D8;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }

  .cta-buttons {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .btn-primary,
  .btn-secondary {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 14px 32px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: #C2410C;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    background: #EA580C;
  }

  .btn-secondary {
    background: transparent;
    border: 2px solid #FB923C;
    color: #FB923C;
  }

  .btn-secondary:hover {
    background: #FB923C;
    color: #07070C;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .playbook-hero h1 {
      font-size: 32px;
    }

    .cta-buttons {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
</style>
